openMCX modifications of the srsRAN Project gNB
================================================

The image openmcx-srsran-gnb built from this directory contains the srsRAN Project gNB (Software Radio Systems
Limited, https://github.com/srsran/srsRAN_Project), tag release_25_10, commit
d2f4b70dda8e2c557d5b05a0ac5f92dbddda19bc, modified by openMCX for tutorial 4. The image openmcx-srsue contains srsUE
from srsRAN 4G (https://github.com/srsran/srsRAN_4G), tag release_25_10, commit
6bcbd9e5bf8686aa7085202cd847c5ddd64a9c16, unmodified.

