Modifications (AGPL-3.0 section 5(a))
-------------------------------------
Each modified file carries the notice "Modified by openMCX, 2026 (MCX N5 QoS)". The changes, as patches against
commit d2f4b70:

  patches/srsran-project/0001   A PDU Session Resource Modify Request whose QoS flows cannot be added (for example
                                because max_nof_drbs_per_ue is reached) no longer makes the gNB release the UE. As
                                TS 38.413 8.2.3.2 specifies, the gNB keeps the previous configuration, passes the
                                NAS-PDU only for a PDU session that is modified, reports a refused QoS flow in the QoS
                                Flow Failed to Add or Modify List, and a PDU session with nothing left to modify in the
                                Failed to Modify List (cause radio resources not available).
  patches/srsran-project/0002   The modification notices.

Corresponding source
--------------------
The complete source of openmcx-srsran-gnb is the upstream repository at the commit above with the patches applied,
in order; the Dockerfile in this directory does exactly that and checks the commit. The image also contains the
patches and a SOURCE file (/usr/share/doc/srsran-project/) naming the commit and each patch's SHA-256. The source of
openmcx-srsue is the upstream repository at its commit.

Rebuild: srsran/build-images.sh (or the docker build commands at the top of the Dockerfile).
